  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe kabidi, muana wa muntu, ambila mikuna ya mu Isalele dî dia baprofete, uyambile ne. Nuenu mikuna ya mu Isalele, unvuai dî dia Yehowa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, bualu bua badi nʼenu lukuna bakunuseka ne, Aka! Mikuna yaya ya kale yakulua buhianyi buetu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku uyambile ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi Wamba ne, Bualu bua bakunubutula, bakununyanga ku nseke yonso, bua nuenu nuikale buhianyi bua bisamba bikuabo bia bantu, ne bualu bua bakutela mena enu kudi bena musoko, ne bakunsonguela munkatshi mua bantu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua malu â, nuenu mikuna ya mu Isalele, unvuai dî dia Mukelenge Yehowa! Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamhila mikuna mile ne mikuna mikese, bihongo ne bibanda, miaba yakubutuka ne misoko yakushala bikulu, biakulua bu tshintu tshia kunyengabo ne kusekabo kudi bisamba bikuabo bidi binunyunguluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bulelela, nakuamba dî mu kahia ka mukau wanyi bua kuhisha nʼadi ba mu bisamba bikuabo bia bantu, ne bua kuhisha nʼadi ba mu buloba buonso bua Edome, badi badisunguila buloba buanyi bu buhianyi buabo, benza nunku ne disanka dinene ne mitshima ya lukuna, bua kubukuata bu tshintu tshidibo banyenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua malu â, amba biebe mei ebe bualu bua buloba bua Isalele, ambila mikuna minene ne mikuna mikese, bihongo ne bibanda ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Monai, nakuamba dî mu mukau wanyi ne mu tshiji tshianyi tshikole, bualu bua nuakufuishibua bundu kudi ba mu bisamba bia bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nakubisha tshianza tshianyi bua kuditshiha ne, Ba mu bisamba bidi binunyunguluka nebadituadile bundu buabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nuenu, mikuna ya mu Isalele, nenuele ntonga yenu, nenukuamine bantu banyi Bena Isalele mamuma enu, bualu bua bobo nebalueku tshituha tshihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangilai bienu, ndi ku luseke luenu, nempingane kunudi, ne nebadime buloba buenu, nebakunemu maminu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nennuvudishe ba bungi, nuenu bonso ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele; misoko neyikale ne bantu, nebibake mu miaba yakadi mibutuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenvudishe bantu ne bimuna bia bungi; nebivulangane, nebilele bana ba bungi; nenjadike ba bungi munkatshi muenu bu muakadi bualu buenu diambedi, nennuenzele bienzedi bimpe bihite bia mu matuku enu a ku tshibangidilu; nunku nenumanye ne, Meme ndi Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nengendeshe bantu ha mutu heńu kabidi, bantu banyi Bena Isalele mene; nebanuangate bu bintu biabo, nenuikale buhianyi buabo ne kanuena nubashiya kabayi ne bana kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bualu bua bantu badi bakuambila ne, Wewe buloba bua Isalele udi mudi wa bantu, udi unyenga bana baledibue kudi bantu bebe kabidi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku kuena udia kabidi bantu, kuena unyenga kabidi bana baledibue kudibo. Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba dî edi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Tshiena ngitabusha bua wewe kunvua kabidi mei a bihendu adi ba mu bisamba bia bantu bamba bua bualu buebe, ne kuena wikala ne bualu bua kuitabusha bihendu bia bantu ba bende kabidi, ne kuena ulenduisha ba mu tshisamba tshiebe kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi kabidi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, hakadi Bena Isalele bashikama mu buloba buabo, bakabunyanga ne bilele biabo ne bienzedi biabo. Bilele biabo biakadi ku mpala kuanyi bu bukoya bua mukashi utshidi ku katshetshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua malu â nakabahongoluela tshiji tshianyi tshikole bualu bua mashi akadibo bamatshisha ha buloba ne bualu bua bakabunyanga ne mpingu yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabamuangalasha munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu, ne bakatangadishibua munkatshi mua maloba makuabo; nakabalumbuluisha bu muakadi bilele biabo bibi ne bienzedi biabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafikabo munkatshi mua bisamba abi kuakayabo, bakanyanga dina dianyi dia tshijila; bualu bua bantu bakuabo bakamba bua bualu buabo ne, Aba mbantu ba Yehowa, bakaluhuka mu buloba buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nakasua bantu bonso banemeke dina dianyi dia tshijila, diakadi Bena Isalele banyanga munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu kuakayabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku ambila Bena Isalele ne, Yehowa udi wamba ne, Tshiena ngenza malu â bua bualu buenu, nuenu Bena Isalele, kadi ndi ngenza bualu bua dina dianyi dia tshijila dinuakanyanga munkatshi mua bisamba abi munuakaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nenjidile dina dianyi dinene diakanyangabo munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu, dinuakanyanga bienu mene munkatshi muabo; ne ba mu bisamba abi nebamanye ne, Meme ndi Yehowa, hanadimuenesha bu Wa Tshijila ku mpala kuabo ku bienzedi bindi nnuenzela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua nennuhatule munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu, nennusangishe bua kunûmusha munkatshi mua maloba makuabo, nendue nʼenu mu buloba buenu mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nennumiamine mai matoke tô, nenuikale bakane; nennulengeshe ku bukoya buenu buonso ne ku mpingu yenu yonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nennuhe mutshima muhia-muhia kabidi, nenteke nyuma muhia-muhia munda muenu; nengumushe mutshima udi bu dibue munda muenu, nennuhe mutshima wa buntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenteke Nyuma wanyi munda muenu, nennuendeshe mu mikenji yanyi mifunda, nenutumikile mikenji yanyi, nengenze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenushikame mu buloba bunakaha batatu benu; nenuikale bantu banyi, meme nengikale Nzambi wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neanuhandishe ku malu enu onso a bukoya. Nembikile maminu enu bua kuluau, nengakumbashe, ne tshiena ntuma tshiole tshikuabo munkatshi muenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenkumbashe mamuma ku mitshi ne bia kudia mu madimi, bua kabanuhendi kabidi kudi ba munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu bualu bua tshiole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
