              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nengitabushe kabidi bua Bena Isalele bandombe bua mbenzele muanda eu wa kubakumbashila bantu bua bikale ba bungi bu tshisumbu tshia mikoko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bu tshisumbu tshia mikoko yakajidilabo bu milambu ya kufila kudi Yehowa, bu tshisumbu tshia mikoko ya mu Yelushalema mu bikondo bia bidia biabo bia disanka, nunku misoko yakadi bikulu diambedi neyule tente ne bisumbu bia bantu; nunku nebamanye ne, Meme ndi Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
